# Personal Claude Code settings — hooks, local tool config. Shared agent/skill
# definitions under .claude/agents/ and .claude/skills/ ARE committed; this is
# the per-developer overlay (e.g. a design-checking hook from installing the
# Impeccable skill locally) and should not silently start running in everyone
# else's session just because one machine has it installed.
.claude/settings.local.json
.codex/settings.local.json

# Impeccable's own compiled engine — a per-platform binary (Windows/Mac/Linux
# each get a different one) plus its supporting scripts, all regenerated by
# `npx impeccable install` on whichever machine needs it. The skill's actual
# knowledge (reference/*.md, SKILL.md) is committed above; the engine binary
# is not something to ship in git for teammates on a different OS to inherit.
.claude/skills/impeccable/scripts/
.github/skills/impeccable/scripts/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

